### COMPRESSION CROSSOVER — link speed below which a dtype step is worth 10% of T_token
  criterion: bytes_saved / BW  >  0.10 * T_token   =>   BW < bytes_saved / (0.10*T_token)
  fp32->bf16  saves  7,168 B/token | CPU decode, measured 123.94 ms     -> pays below     0.58 MB/s =       4.6 Mbit/s
  fp32->bf16  saves  7,168 B/token | GPU-class runtime, modelled 1.5 ms -> pays below    47.79 MB/s =     382.3 Mbit/s
  bf16->int8  saves  3,544 B/token | CPU decode, measured 123.94 ms     -> pays below     0.29 MB/s =       2.3 Mbit/s
  bf16->int8  saves  3,544 B/token | GPU-class runtime, modelled 1.5 ms -> pays below    23.63 MB/s =     189.0 Mbit/s
  fp32->int8  saves 10,712 B/token | CPU decode, measured 123.94 ms     -> pays below     0.86 MB/s =       6.9 Mbit/s
  fp32->int8  saves 10,712 B/token | GPU-class runtime, modelled 1.5 ms -> pays below    71.41 MB/s =     571.3 Mbit/s
